Phase boundary (kalsa-energy-rep-v3): stamped decode = [mark_N - predicted_ms/1000, mark_N)
and stamped prefill = [mark_N - predicted_ms/1000 - prompt_ms/1000, mark_N - predicted_ms/1000).
Prefill is prompt evaluation through the first generated token; load+idle is the earlier remainder.
Each bucket reports nominal and sampler-integrated seconds, and j_load_idle + j_prefill + j_decode
equals the whole-window J exactly. Missing stamps use v2 arithmetic and are named per row.
